  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During Qin Bai Sheng’s assault on Lang Ya blessed land, Thirteenth Hair and Twelfth Hair surround Qin Bai Sheng protectively and help the enemy. Other hairy man Gu Immortals call them traitors and refuse to believe it, saying both grew up in the blessed land. Lang Ya land spirit orders them killed. After the attackers withdraw, the two join Shadow Sect talk: with soul replacement they can possess more undercover agents, they only managed three hairy man Gu Immortal moles, and with two exposed they would need at least three hundred years to accumulate more. Qin Bai Sheng notes that one mole remains hidden and turns the group toward Luo Po Valley instead of pressing Lang Ya further.",
